{"verse_key": "10:108", "surah": 10, "verse": 108, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ قَدْ جَآءَكُمُ ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكُمْ ۖ فَمَنِ ٱهْتَدَىٰ فَإِنَّمَا يَهْتَدِى لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن ضَلَّ فَإِنَّمَا يَضِلُّ عَلَيْهَا ۖ وَمَآ أَنَا۠ عَلَيْكُم بِوَكِيلٍ", "translation": "Say, \"O mankind, the truth has come to you from your Lord, so whoever is guided is only guided for [the benefit of] his soul, and whoever goes astray only goes astray [in violation] against it. And I am not over you a manager.\"", "verse_from_ms": 2301270, "verse_to_ms": 2328410, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 2301270, "end_ms": 2301900}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا", "start_ms": 2301900, "end_ms": 2304430}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلنَّاسُ", "start_ms": 2304430, "end_ms": 2305600}, {"i": 3, "text": "قَدْ", "start_ms": 2305600, "end_ms": 2306030}, {"i": 4, "text": "جَآءَكُمُ", "start_ms": 2306030, "end_ms": 2308220}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "start_ms": 2308220, "end_ms": 2309040}, {"i": 6, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 2309040, "end_ms": 2309310}, {"i": 7, "text": "رَّبِّكُمْ", "start_ms": 2309310, "end_ms": 2310420}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 2310420, "end_ms": 2311850}, {"i": 9, "text": "فَمَنِ", "start_ms": 2311850, "end_ms": 2312610}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱهْتَدَىٰ", "start_ms": 2312610, "end_ms": 2314220}, {"i": 11, "text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "start_ms": 2314220, "end_ms": 2315240}, {"i": 12, "text": "يَهْتَدِى", "start_ms": 2315240, "end_ms": 2316310}, {"i": 13, "text": "لِنَفْسِهِۦ", "start_ms": 2316310, "end_ms": 2317410}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 2317410, "end_ms": 2318090}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَمَن", "start_ms": 2318090, "end_ms": 2319700}, {"i": 16, "text": "ضَلَّ", "start_ms": 2319700, "end_ms": 2320530}, {"i": 17, "text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "start_ms": 2320530, "end_ms": 2321500}, {"i": 18, "text": "يَضِلُّ", "start_ms": 2321500, "end_ms": 2323560}, {"i": 19, "text"